# Worth Rises
#
# Drop photos for this role here, then list them on its entry in
# src/components/Experience.astro via the optional images field:
#   images: [{ src: '/images/experience/worth-rises/file.jpg', alt: '…' }]
# They render as a photo grid inside that role's detail modal.
#
# Process raw camera files FIRST (they must not be committed as-is):
#   node scripts/process-community-media.mjs experience/worth-rises worth-rises --from <raw dir>
